      "published_date": "2026-11-04T06:54:45+00:00",
      "category": "Open Source",
      "description": "​A real Claude Opus 5.5 agent log: 97.5% of prompt tokens were cache hits, so 35 calls came to $2.39 at list prices instead of $22.08. A 101-line script checks your own logs, and shows why a broken cache can cost nearly double.Without prompt caching, the Claude agent session I measured would have cost 9.2x as much at list prices: $22.08 instead of $2.39, for exactly the same tokens. Below is a script that reads your own Claude Code logs and tells you your cache hit rate, what it saves you, and...",
